  "description": "Brand the Umbraco backoffice sign-in page from inside the backoffice, instead of editing appsettings.json and redeploying. The background and both logos are chosen with the standard media picker, so nothing is uploaded or duplicated. Umbraco's decorative curves can be recoloured or switched off. Changes apply without a restart, nothing is written to disk, and a granular user-group permission controls who may change the design. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Umbraco A/S. Umbraco is a trademark of Umbraco A/S.",
